          "items": [
            "Welcome to SALT & WATER, a refined yet family-friendly 5-bedroom WaterColor retreat in the desirable Camp District. Just a short walk or quick 2-minute bike ride to Camp WaterColor, this beautifully designed home blends upscale finishes with relaxed coastal living. A 6-seat golf cart/LSV is included for easy beach days and exploring the community.<br>The inviting front porch sets the tone for vacation living. Inside, the open-concept living space is filled with natural light and overlooks a peaceful nature preserve, offering rare privacy and a calm coastal backdrop.<br>The gourmet kitchen is designed for gathering and entertaining, featuring a Wolf gas range, Sub-Zero refrigerator and freezer, built-in ice maker, wine bar, quiet Bosch dishwasher, and a large quartz island. A second porch off the kitchen invites alfresco dining surrounded by lush greenery.<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>Primary suite with king bed, spa-style ensuite bath, and private balcony<br>Guest bedroom with king bed and ensuite bath<br>Guest bedroom with queen bed and ensuite bath<br>Shared balcony with lake views<br>A central lounge includes seating, TV, game table, and built-in desk. Sliding barn doors allow the space to close for privacy. A spiral staircase leads to the third floor.<br><br><br>Third Floor<br><br>Guest bedroom with king bed<br>Guest bedroom with queen bed<br>Shared bathroom<br>Lounge with TV, bean bag seating, and game table—perfect for kids and teens<br>Comfort & Wellness<br>For added comfort, the home features AprilAire MERV-11 air filtration and dual REME Halo LED air purifiers, designed to reduce airborne pollutants and odors.<br><br><br>Why Guests Love Salt & Water<br>Walk or bike to Camp WaterColor<br> Golf cart included<br> Multiple living and lounge spaces<br> Private preserve views<br> High-end appliances and finishes<br> Ideal for families and multi-generational groups<br><br>HIGHLY SOUGHT-AFTER LOCATION — BOOK NOW WHILE DATES ARE AVAILABLE!",
